      "title": "Android visibility",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Battery, memory, storage and CPU frequency are collected from Android. CPU frequency is **not utilization**. System CPU utilization and network throughput are restricted on this phone and omitted from this dashboard. Source availability shows 1 = readable, 0 = restricted/unavailable. Data is sampled every 5 seconds and retained for 7 days."
      }
